{"title":"Small Coral Snake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 6 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .6 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"coral-snake-small\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Snake: <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium\">Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large\">Large Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-small\">Small Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large\">Large Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/c2a34945ae8f7285c5c7.webp\" alt=\"Small Coral Snake\"></div><h3>Small Coral Snake</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th>